$ gofmt -l .
$ go build -o release . && ./release
version="dev" commit="" channel="stable" fromConst="0.0.0" build=0
$ go build -ldflags "-X main.version=1.4.2 -X main.commit=9f3a1c0 -X main.channel=beta -X main.fromConst=2.0" -o release . && ./release
version="1.4.2" commit="9f3a1c0" channel="stable" fromConst="2.0" build=0
recorded in the binary: -ldflags=-X main.version=1.4.2 -X main.commit=9f3a1c0 -X main.channel=beta -X main.fromConst=2.0
$ go build -ldflags "-X main.build=7" -o release .
