main.build: cannot set with -X: not a var of type string (type:int)
exit status 1
$ go build -ldflags "-X main.nosuch=1" -o release . && ./release
version="dev" commit="" channel="stable" fromConst="0.0.0" build=0
recorded in the binary: -ldflags=-X main.nosuch=1
exit status 0
$ go build -ldflags "-s -w -X main.version=1.4.2" -o stripped . && ./stripped
version="1.4.2" commit="" channel="stable" fromConst="0.0.0" build=0
recorded in the binary: -ldflags=-s -w -X main.version=1.4.2
stripped is smaller: yes
